WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:02.996
(raptor screaming)

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:07.607
(wings thumping)

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:08.838
(trap snapping)
- Got him.

00:00:08.838 --> 00:00:11.588
(dramatic music)

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.830
For as long as I can remember,

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.640
my life has been about one
thing: animals. (laughing)

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.440
Over the years, the animal
books turned into pets,

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.890
which turned into working
with bears in the wild.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.230
This obsession has taken
me up into pine trees

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.450
and down into bear dens.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.000
Hey, get back.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.240
But I'd do anything for these animals,

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.163
and I know that I'm not alone.

00:00:35.488 --> 00:00:36.340
(bold dramatic music)

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.460
Now, I'm on a mission.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.770
I'm traveling across the country

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:43.250
to find young conservationists
driven by that same passion.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.863
Oh, got a gator.

00:00:44.863 --> 00:00:46.110
Wow.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.700
We'll get up close and
personal with wildlife.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.250
- Half cc ket.
- To discover how they fit

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.429
into the bigger picture.
- That needle ray did.

00:00:52.429 --> 00:00:54.550
- All the way up.
- All the way up.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.470
- [Wes] I'll find the people
on the front lines of the fight

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.940
to understand our planet
and protect the animals

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.390
we share it with.
- When they squirm,

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.420
you don't grab a tail.
(sea lions barking)

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.880
- [Wes] And if it gets a
little messy along the way--

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.390
- [Woman] Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.660
- [Wes] That's just part of the job.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.082
I'm Wes Larson, this is Mission Wild.

00:01:11.082 --> 00:01:13.999
(raptor screaming)

00:01:15.497 --> 00:01:18.164
(tones chiming)

